WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.033
Everything on Snow.

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:09.433
Snow. The snow log and snow billing: how many properties, visits logged and what is ready to bill.

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:16.067
Log a visit. For a visit the crew didn't log on the phone, or from the paper snow log.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:19.767
Property. The property, from its snow plan.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:22.600
Date. The day of the visit.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:29.867
Storm. Name the storm to group its visits (e.g. February 8 storm). Blank groups them by date.

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:36.100
Snowfall. Inches at the property. Snowfall pricing uses the biggest per storm.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:43.167
Time in and out. When the crew arrived and left, and how many men; hourly pricing uses them.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:48.233
Truck, driver, crew. Which plow truck, who drove, and the crew.

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:53.400
What was done. Plowed the lot, Salted, Shoveled walks, Calcium.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.833
Salt, ice melt, loader. How much salt and ice melt went down, and the loader hours.

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:06.167
Site condition. How it was left, e.g. Clear · icy spots by the door.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:11.833
Save the visit. Log visit saves it to the log. The tour doesn't press it.

00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:17.000
Close the form. The x closes the form without saving anything.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:27.000
Bill snow. One draft invoice per customer for every unbilled visit on a priced plan (it asks first). Check and send them from Invoices.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.633
A storm. Visits grouped by storm: the date, how many properties and visits, billed or not, and the biggest snowfall.

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:45.233
A visit. Property, times, hours, men, truck, driver, whether it came from the crew app, the site condition, what was done, and any photos.

00:01:45.733 --> 00:01:49.700
Change a visit. Opens the visit in the same form.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:57.667
Remove a visit. Removes it (it asks first). A billed visit shows its invoice number instead and can't change.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:05.300
Snow plans. One plan per property, made on Maintenance (how often: Snow). New plan takes you there.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:13.767
Visits to bill. Logged visits on that property not billed yet. A yellow banner warns when a plan has no pricing.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:22.200
Pricing. How the property is billed: by snowfall or by the hour. Tour: "Price snow by snowfall or by the hour".

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:27.500
To bill. Each customer's total ready to bill, priced from their plan.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.833
See the lines. Click a customer to see each visit's line and price.

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:38.933
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
